OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome patchy low cloud in the
OL,6,Fmorning. Staying mostly dry, with
OL,7,Fspells of warm sunshine developing
OL,8,Flater. Best of the sunshine across the
OL,9,Fsouth of the region. Winds staying
OL,10,Flight throughout.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FStaying dry overnight with
OL,13,Fcloud lowering across higher ground to
OL,14,Fthe west. Otherwise, clear spells for
OL,15,Fmany but feeling mild.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FAny low cloud firth thing
OL,18,Fwill start to lift during the morning,
OL,19,Fbringing bright and sunny spells for
OL,20,Fmany. Risk of thunderstorms developing
OL,21,Flater. Warmer than Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
